    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30765" root="عنف" body-key="E">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعنّف</span></b>  is expl. by Golius as signifying <i>Incommodè et imperitè aggressus fuit</i> rem, et <i>incepit;</i>
on the authority of the S: but it is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعتنف</span> that
has this, or a similar, meaning.]

